OL,3,GNEWSALittle tern comeback colony hit by
OL,4,Afox attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FAttacks by predators have hit years of
OL,7,Fslow recovery for the last little tern
OL,8,Fcolony in the south-west of England,
OL,9,Fconservationists have said.
OL,11,FSixty-six breeding pairs were recorded
OL,12,Fat Chesil Beach in Dorset this year,
OL,13,Fwhich was the highest number since
OL,14,F2001, the RSPB reported.
OL,16,FHowever, the colony was targeted by a
OL,17,Ffox which probably got through a
OL,18,Fdefective fence, the charity added.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
